# ── Xcode: file milik user, bukan milik project ──────────────────────────
# Ini yang paling penting. Isinya posisi window, breakpoint, scheme pribadi —
# beda per orang, dan jadi sumber konflik merge kalau ikut ke-push.
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout

# ── Hasil build ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
DerivedData/
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM
*.dSYM.zip
*.moved-aside

# ── Swift Package Manager ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.build/
.swiftpm/xcode/package.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/

# ── Dependency manager (belum dipakai, tapi aman disiapkan) ─────────────
Pods/
Carthage/Build/

# ── macOS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# ── Catatan ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WhisperWood.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj SENGAJA di-track (jangan di-ignore) —
# itu definisi project-nya, wajib ikut supaya orang lain bisa buka & build.
